Finished? YES
Your recording is the attract screen's music now, in 0.10.7: 8.7 MB of 48 kHz stereo, 80 seconds, looped
gaplessly through the music bus, so the music slider moves it, the mute out-mutes it, and the
player-hit muffle ducks it like anything else on that bus. It plays on the menu and nowhere else, and
that is not a hedge: the sequencer earns its keep by answering the run - a boss walking in, a hull going,
the two minutes that buy the drum kit - and a fixed song would be deaf to all of it. So while your song
